### Add a pet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bamse",
  "species": "Cat",
  "hungerLevel": 6,
  "happiness": 10
}

### List all pets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets

### Get a pet by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1

### Feed a pet
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1/feed

### Play with a pet
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1/play

### Delete a pet
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1